OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 13 JUN
OL,4,G0000FDance Sounds of the 90s with
OL,5,     FVernon Kay
OL,6,     GIn the 90s, 'Carpet Clubs' were
OL,7,     Gvenues with a sticky floor, cheap
OL,8,     Gdrinks, a decent sound system and
OL,9,     Ga dry ice machine! We remember
OL,10,     Gthem with an hour of sing-a-long
OL,11,     Gdance classics!
OL,12,G0100FTony Blackburn's Sounds of Soul
OL,13,     GTony serves up more tasty soul
OL,14,     Gvibes and R&B flavours! Including
OL,15,     Gbrilliant music from Sister
OL,16,     GSledge, Mtume, Marvin Gaye,
OL,17,     GMichael Jackson, Patrice Isley
OL,18,     Gand Stevie Wonder!
